  "body": "### What is the expected enhancement?\n\nOnce #668 and #866 are implemented, the old `VibrationalIntegrals` class should be removed in favor of using the `PolynomialTensor`. This matches what I have done for the electronic-structure stack in #841.\r\n\r\nThis will also enable the extraction of the `basis` attribute from the `VibrationalEnergy` hamiltonian and `OccupiedModals` property onto the `VibrationalStructureProblem` (again; the same was done for the electronic structure stack). This in turn, will enable the extension of the `BasisTransformer` to transform between different vibrational structure bases in the future.",
